        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81586710?u=432678424793bd56d22e6932670f86934ff70e92&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">This RFC is a proposal for so-called \"safe blocks\" that would provide the opposite effect of unsafe blocks.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://github.com/AverseABFun/rfcs/blob/master/text/3768-safe-blocks.md\">Rendered</a></p>",
